}},{"title":"承张罗峰阁老手书野外送鱼之作见示倚韵奉和二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"宇宙恢恢是广居，沧溟泼泼有长鱼。\n若在相公怀度内，乾坤此乐更无馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承张罗峰阁老手书野外送鱼之作见示倚韵奉和二首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"燮理由来在相门，盎中潜跃化机存。\n枯鳞涸辙知多少，一并烦公达圣尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马氏寿图","author":"湛若水","text":"蓬莱弱水何年浅，王母蟠桃几度偷。\n若问长生即无算，海中何必计添筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为霍武学请送刘都阃","author":"湛若水","text":"楼船箫鼓动秋清，剑气寒光下紫冥。\n想得将军经略外，时时骑马看潮生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈子望诸生求言","author":"湛若水","text":"陈生屡屡求予言，欲言未言意先传。\n始知无言是至教，四时百物无非天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄秀卿地官部运西边","author":"湛若水","text":"木牛流马缘何事，会计元同一贯心。\n馈饷元功能画一，秋风揽辔一沉吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松泉图为张伯牧中舍","author":"湛若水","text":"松泉之图心外景，何以邮之称我心。\n我心似有松泉在，流地参天万万寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠大鸿胪黄斋王先生","author":"湛若水","text":"五色云中瑞日光，朝朝休命对宣扬。\n长摇青佩窥青锁，玉韵亲承拱玉皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于刘子所见白鹿山人蔡君诗戏作","author":"湛若水","text":"白鹿山人白眼多，胸中垒磈柰君何。\n昨宵梦语阳明月，又共天台月底歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"颇忆南观牛首山，献花天女佩珊珊。\n上方闻钟只欲到，返照入林犹未还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"观音岩高临大流，杨子江深多睡虬。\n怪景千千如怵目，行人往往欲停舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"杉云窈窕作深洞，灵谷人传谷有灵。\n移带飞泉佛力大，可能说法鬼神听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"白下一台留雨花，天花吹散万人家。\n长江不洗台城恨，纵有清修亦乱华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其五","author":"湛若水","text":"我昔与客登东山，谢墩王墩荒草间。\n无端更说争墩事，新法如何得解颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其六","author":"湛若水","text":"清人爱杀梅花水，水弄梅花清杀人。\n我有清诗传不尽，更凭雪月写精神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其七","author":"湛若水","text":"清凉清凉吾爱之，直欲结托清心脾。\n救火事忙胜执热，兰膏自焚谁自悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵八咏 其八","author":"湛若水","text":"蒋山鸡埠跨城隅，双瞰成均汇后湖。\n忠节卞公同庙食，昭明文艺亦知无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"王气金陵定有无，瓜分鼎分皆霸图。\n普天全付高皇烈，无论南都与北都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"高皇不北意何如，文祖燕都控虏胡。\n高倚天山施裂决，风雷迅急百蛮呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"万水朝宗来海门，居然仰受万方尊。\n除凶刷耻今皇祖，未许唐宗谩拟伦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"冶城山下朝天宫，万岁巍然殿顶中。\n不以朝天南受贺，南宫西面义何从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其五","author":"湛若水","text":"三山山外青天外，合作无穷如是观。\n道人独立无穷外，但见乾坤小一丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其六","author":"湛若水","text":"天堑长江城石头，偏安誇羡未能休。\n太行为郭中原北，天险黄河到海流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其七","author":"湛若水","text":"钟山爱我如居静，我爱钟山似展眉。\n相爱也堪相信得，不应移我勒铭诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵后八咏 其八","author":"湛若水","text":"冶城山西谒卞公，三匝三叹意何穷。\n若得如公百数辈，叛卒何忧乎大同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"湛若水","text":"身经六十八除夕，除去为劳天亦深。\n还有病根除未去，膏肓泉石更婴心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官居杂咏四绝句 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"堂东小池二丈赊，池边古木集昏鸦。\n天光池上无多子，槐柏三株纵意遮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]